	  stripped now. Fixed up some edge cases in some iterators, and also
	  added "..." support to XIter (/foo/.../snoot will match
	  /foo/snoot, /foo/x/snoot, /foo/x/y/snoot, etc). Removed features
	  from RecursiveIter in the process, since what people always really
	  want is UniConfDepth::DESCENDENTS (I think).

