	  caching First draft of UniConfClient caching support. We might
	  need to add a prefetching mechanism to the UniConfGen API to speed
	  up initial queries distinct from the refresh() mechanism. We want
	  refresh() to be as fast as possible since it is usually called
	  upon mounting a generator. Prefetching would therefore be kept
	  separate for those who are willing to take the performance hit at
	  precisely the times they need.

