	  Created a shell script to test the UniConfDaemon more thoroughly.
	  Currently looks at all files of the format: daemontest*.txt and
	  passes them to nc to send to the daemon. Results are then recorded
	  in res_daemontest*.txt files, and diffed with expected results. If
	  there is a difference, a less session is brought up with the
	  results of the diff. There is a help feature to the script,
	  accessible by daemontest.sh -h To add new tests, simply create a
	  new daemontest*.txt file, and a new real_res_daemontest*.txt file
	  containing the expected results of the operations.

