2002-11-09 07:15  pphaneuf

	* trunk/wvstreams/configfile/vars.mk,
	  trunk/wvstreams/crypto/tests/vars.mk,
	  trunk/wvstreams/crypto/vars.mk, trunk/wvstreams/fft/vars.mk,
	  trunk/wvstreams/ipstreams/vars.mk,
	  trunk/wvstreams/linuxstreams/vars.mk,
	  trunk/wvstreams/oggvorbis/vars.mk, trunk/wvstreams/qt/rules.mk,
	  trunk/wvstreams/qt/vars.mk, trunk/wvstreams/rules.mk,
	  trunk/wvstreams/streams/vars.mk, trunk/wvstreams/uniconf/vars.mk,
	  trunk/wvstreams/urlget/tests/vars.mk,
	  trunk/wvstreams/urlget/vars.mk,
	  trunk/wvstreams/utils/tests/vars.mk,
	  trunk/wvstreams/utils/vars.mk, trunk/wvstreams/vars.mk: WvStreams
	  makefile changes, part of the "The Miracle Diet Makefile" plan.
	  Added an "objects" function that takes directories and expands to
	  the name of the object files that should be in there (takes all
	  the .cc and .c files and turn them into .o). Removed a bunch of
	  vars.mk files by replacing them with uses of the "objects"
	  function higher up. Added a VERBOSE variable that is the moral
	  equivalent of what DONT_LIE did, so you get get the details when
	  something goes wrong. Added an implicit target for going from a
	  .cc to an executable. Including your subdirs vars.mk and rules.mk
	  is now done at the top level, so you don't need to do it anymore.
	  Switched from using funky variable variable names (like
	  "libwvutils.so-LIBS") to using target-local variables. Fixed a
	  number of mostly aesthetic buglets.

