	  WvStreams - later, I'll add a WvEncoderStream that can attach
	  separate WvEncoders for read() and write(), thereby replacing the
	  functionality of WvCryptoStream. Added WvGzip and WvXOR test
	  encoders. Eventually WvTape should migrate to using a WvGzip
	  encoder, I guess. In the meantime, cleaned up WvCryptoStream
	  without using WvEncoder, and started adding udp support to tunnelv
	  (but didn't get very far with that yet).

