	  returns 0 if there are no packets to read.

2001-10-15 17:09  apenwarr

	* trunk/wvstreams/ipstreams/wvipfirewall.cc,
	  trunk/wvstreams/ipstreams/wvtcp.cc: Changed rootdisk so /dev/zero,
	  /dev/null, and /dev/tty are symlinks to /tmp/dev/*. romfs only
	  supports root-accessible devices, which really confuses things
	  that try to redirect to /dev/null as non-root... Fixed
