	  [softupdate] use private = 1, which uses the PHP script at cereal
	  port 81. Also increased version to 3.21f2, which (for the sake of
	  sanity) is now 3.22 pre-2. We will all look forward to 3.22 now.
	  All that's left to add is automatic assigning of serial numbers to
	  machines that don't have them.

